NOT A MEDICAL DEVICE. NOT FOR CLINICAL USE.

This software performs computational prioritisation of candidate therapeutic
proteins. Its outputs are model predictions, not evidence of therapeutic
effect, safety, or efficacy. No sequence or structure it produces is a drug.
Experimental validation is required before any output is relied upon for any
purpose. Nothing produced by this software should be used to guide the
treatment of any patient.
